{"id":"n14917-1-9","stage":2,"title":"되돌아오다 · 返回","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14917-1-9-1","ko":"유학 간 친구에게 편지를 보냈는데 그 편지가 되돌아왔어.","zh":"我给去留学的朋友寄了信，结果那封信被退回来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유학","meaning":"留学","explanation":"유학：留学。","readings":[{"term":"유학","audio":"/audio/4c52a19db898d399dde7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70244","senseId":"1","lemma":"유학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유학","audio":"/audio/4c52a19db898d399dde7.mp3"}},{"text":"간","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"간","audio":"/audio/74ca8db3a8d704900080.mp3"}},{"text":"친구에게","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구에게","audio":"/audio/93a1734a26b6cd1e234b.mp3"}},{"text":"편지를","meaning":"信，书信，信件","explanation":"편지：信，书信，信件；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"편지","audio":"/audio/53bf9898bc47c0e12c02.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24147","senseId":"1","lemma":"편지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"편지를","audio":"/audio/2c9dab56a674fd28e2f8.mp3"}},{"text":"보냈는데","meaning":"送，寄","explanation":"보내다：送，寄；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"1","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보냈는데","audio":"/audio/826aeb4f09cc031b26ee.mp3"}},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"so